  "problem_context": {
    "problem_statement": "Rewrite the CircularAreaRead specification in the CRTOS idmanager style. The current contract exposes data_buffer, readidx, writeidx, area_length, b_status, operations, logical, physical, pointer aliases, and request aliases as separate With variables. Replace this flat resource interface with the shared circular_area record and store_circular_area ownership predicate already present in QCIPLib/xizi/xizi_circular_area_common/xizi_circular_area_lib.v. Modify only the Read case formal files. Preserve the existing C implementation and reuse the existing 36 proof bodies/patterns incrementally; do not redesign or rewrite the proof from scratch.",
    "target_function": "CircularAreaRead",
    "expected_behavior": "Read requires a valid abstract FIFO state and unified store_circular_area ownership. Invalid pointers, zero request, and empty FIFO return ERROR=1 and preserve the state/resource. A successful read returns EOK=0, consumes min(requested, logical length), advances read index, sets status to 0, preserves the ring physical storage, and initializes exactly the consumed output prefix while preserving the remaining mixed output suffix.",
    "input_output_contract": "Use With only for one circular_area abstract pre-state plus unavoidable external output-buffer state/capacity and GlobalStrings map. Hide data_buffer and operations existentially inside store_circular_area. Express the post-state through an existential circular_area and a pure Read transition relation. Use UCharArray::mixed_full/list(option Z) for output. The public contract must contain no separate With variables for internal descriptor fields, internal backing-buffer address, operations pointer, or redundant parameter aliases.",
    "spec_hint": [
      "Keep CircularAreaReadSuccess and existing low-level lemmas as proof adapters. Add record-level Read transition/accessor predicates in the Read case lib instead of mirroring the C algorithm. At the function boundary use CircularAreaValid(state) and store_circular_area(state,circular_area). Inside the body it is permitted to expose existential representation fields through local Assert annotations so existing symbolic-execution and manual proof structure can be reused. Do not edit non-Read function specs."
    ],
    "preferred_hidden_properties": [
      "A Read state transition relates one circular_area pre-state to one circular_area post-state; successful output is map Some consumed_bytes followed by the untouched mixed suffix."
    ],
    "forbidden_patterns": [
      "Do not list internal CircularArea structure fields or internal pointer aliases as separate public With parameters. Do not copy the C algorithm into a Rocq Fixpoint/state machine. Do not weaken force-write semantics or change any non-Read code/spec."
    ],
    "reference_case_hints": [
      "Style reference: crtosverify/lib/idnode.v Record idmanager plus store_idmanager, and crtosverify annotated specs that expose abstract logical state rather than implementation pointers. Proof reuse reference: current xizi_circular_area_read_proof_manual.v and prior Read workflow reports."
    ],
